{!Lead.NTE_Event_Code__c} · Logistics details received

Your logistics details are with us.

The NTE operations team will review your delivery and collection information.

Hello,

We have received updated vehicle, equipment and haulier details for {!Lead.Company}. We will use this information to plan safe paddock access and will contact you if anything needs clarification.

What happens next

Submitting these details does not itself approve a delivery slot. The NTE operations team will confirm final access arrangements separately.

